  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 9ae4abe13f (fx_hodor: my_behaviour.erl + impl.erl with -behaviour(my_behaviour)). erlang.py:719 still mints erlang:<X>:0-0:module:module. In survey output the imports edge dst is erlang:my_behaviour:0-0:module:external_symbol with is_resolved=False, while the implements edge resolves to erlang:src/my_behaviour.erl:1-1:my_behaviour:module. Premise holds; only the rendered placeholder form differs from the title. MECHANISM: behaviour import edge minted with a synthetic module placeholder id instead of the in-repo module symbol id."  # 54f6
